    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/mimo-v2-5/styles.css">

</head>
<body>
    <nav class="site-nav">
        <a href="/" class="site-nav-logo"><img src="/mimo-v2-5/assets/logo.svg" alt="Xiaomi MiMo" class="site-nav-logo-img"></a>
        <a href="/" class="site-nav-back">Back to Home</a>
    </nav>
    <article class="article">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="hero">
            <time class="hero-date" datetime="2026-04-22">April 22nd, 2026</time>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Xiaomi MiMo-<span class="omni-text">V2.5</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">A leap in agency and multimodality.</p>
            <nav class="hero-buttons">
                <a href="https://aistudio.xiaomimimo.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-filled">Try it now <span class="btn-chevron">&rsaquo;</span></a>
                <a href="https://platform.xiaomimimo.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">Access API <span class="btn-chevron">&rsaquo;</span></a>
                <a href="https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">Hugging Face <span class="btn-chevron">&rsaquo;</span></a>
            </nav>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 1: Intro -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Introducing MiMo-V2.5</h2>
            <p>Today, we are releasing MiMo-V2.5, a major step forward in agentic capability and multimodal understanding. With native visual and audio understanding, MiMo-V2.5 reasons seamlessly across modalities, surpasses MiMo-V2-Pro in agentic performance, and supports up to 1 million tokens of context.</p>
            <p>MiMo-V2.5 is a 310B-parameter Sparse MoE model (15B active) trained on 48T tokens. Its language backbone inherits from <a href="https://github.com/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2-Flash" target="_blank">MiMo-V2-Flash</a>'s hybrid sliding-window attention architecture, augmented with dedicated visual and audio encoders (both pretrained in-house) connected through lightweight projectors.</p>

            <figure class="arch-figure">
                <img src="/mimo-v2-5/assets/architecture.svg" alt="MiMo-V2.5 architecture diagram">
                <figcaption>MiMo-V2.5 architecture.</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <p>Training goes through five stages: <em>text pre-training</em> on diverse corpora to build the LLM backbone; <em>projector warmup</em> to align the audio and visual projectors with the language model; <em>multimodal pre-training</em> at scale on high-quality cross-modal data; <em>supervised fine-tuning and agentic post-training</em>, during which the context window is progressively extended from 32K to 256K to 1M; and finally <em>RL and <a href="https://arxiv.org/html/2601.02780v2#S4" target="_blank">MOPD</a></em>, which further strengthens perception, reasoning, and agentic capabilities.</p>
            <p>Together, these stages yield a single model that sees, hears, and acts on what it perceives â€” one that understands everything and gets things done.</p>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- Section 2: Model Overview -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Best-in-Class Agency</h2>
            <!-- <p>MiMo-V2.5 builds on our strong LLM backbone, extended with dedicated visual and audio encoders and an optimized post-training pipeline that jointly aligns perception, reasoning, and tool use.</p> -->
            <p>On the agentic benchmarks that matter most for real-world deployment, MiMo-V2.5 delivers best-in-class performance:</p>


            <div class="bench-block" id="coding-bench">
                <div class="bench-legend" id="coding-legend"></div>
                <div class="bench-grid" id="coding-grid"></div>
            </div>

            <p>In our internal <strong>MiMo Coding Bench</strong>, MiMo-V2.5 delivers strong results on everyday coding tasks, closing the gap with frontier models and matching MiMo-V2.5-Pro at half the cost.</p>
            <p>On <strong>Claw-Eval</strong>, a benchmark for daily agentic tasks, MiMo-V2.5 achieves a 62.3 on the general subset, placing it at the Pareto frontier of performance and efficiency.</p>
                
            <p>These results highlight what makes MiMo-V2.5 unique: frontier-level agentic capability with high token efficiency.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Multimodal Understanding -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Sharper Perception, Longer Horizon</h2>
            <p>MiMo-V2.5 delivers sharper perception for precise visual reasoning, complex chart analysis, and deep multimodal understanding, with native support for up to 1 million tokens of context.</p>

            <div class="bench-block" id="multimodal-bench">
                <div class="bench-legend" id="multimodal-legend"></div>
                <div class="bench-grid" id="multimodal-grid"></div>
            </div>

            <p>Across image, video, and multimodal agentic tasks, MiMo-V2.5 stays level with frontier closed-source models â€” matching Gemini 3 Pro on video, Claude Sonnet 4.6 on multimodal agentic work, and staying competitive across image and document understanding. All from one unified model.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Open Source -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Open Source</h2>
            <p>The MiMo-V2.5 series is now fully open-sourced. Weights, tokenizer, and the full model card are available on Hugging Face.</p>

            <div class="spec-table-wrap">
                <table class="spec-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Model</th>
                            <th>Total Params</th>
                            <th>Active Params</th>
                            <th>Context</th>
                            <th>Precision</th>
                            <th>Download</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>MiMo-V2.5-Base</td>
                            <td>310B</td>
                            <td>15B</td>
                            <td>256K</td>
                            <td>FP8 (E4M3) Mixed</td>
                            <td><a href="https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Base" target="_blank">Hugging Face</a></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>MiMo-V2.5</td>
                            <td>310B</td>
                            <td>15B</td>
                            <td>1M</td>
                            <td>FP8 (E4M3) Mixed</td>
                            <td><a href="https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5" target="_blank">Hugging Face</a></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Token Plan -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Token Plan Update</h2>
            <p>Alongside stronger models, your Token Plan gets better too. Rates are now simpler and lower:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>MiMo-V2.5</strong> â€” 1x (1 token = 1 credit)</li>
                <li><strong>MiMo-V2.5-Pro</strong> â€” 2x (1 token = 2 credits)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>From today onward, Token Plans no longer charge a multiplier for the 1M-token context window. <a href="https://platform.xiaomimimo.com/docs/tokenplan/subscription" target="_blank">Order your Token Plan now</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: What's Next -->
        <section class="section">
            <h2>What's Next</h2>
            <p>MiMo-V2.5 brings frontier agency and native multimodality into the same model, at a price point that makes both practical for production. We are already training the next generation with deeper reasoning, tighter tool integration, and richer real-world grounding. In the meantime, <a href="https://aistudio.xiaomimimo.com/" target="_blank">try it in AI Studio</a> or <a href="https://platform.xiaomimimo.com" target="_blank">access the API</a> â€” we cannot wait to see what you build.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer">
            <p>Xiaomi MiMo Team Â· 2026</p>
        </footer>
    </article>

    <script>
        // ==================== Benchmark Data ====================

        // Shared logo paths (re-used from mimo-v2-pro asset folder)
        const LOGO_XIAOMI    = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/xiaomi.svg';
        const LOGO_ANTHROPIC = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/anthropic.svg';
        const LOGO_GEMINI    = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/gemini.svg';
        const LOGO_OPENAI    = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/openai-black.svg';
        const LOGO_KIMI      = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/kimi.svg';
        const LOGO_DEEPSEEK  = '/mimo-v2-pro/assets/logos/deepseek.svg';

        // ---- Multimodal block ----
        const multimodalModels = [
            { id: 'mimo25',  name: 'MiMo-V2.5',         color: '#FF6700', logo: LOGO_XIAOMI,    highlight: true  },
            { id: 'omni',    name: 'MiMo-V2-Omni',      color: '#8e8e8e', logo: LOGO_XIAOMI,    highlight: false },
            { id: 'kimi',    name: 'Kimi K2.6',         color: '#989898', logo: LOGO_KIMI,      highlight: false },
            { id: 'opus46',  name: 'Claude Opus 4.6',   color: '#a0a0a0', logo: LOGO_ANTHROPIC, highlight: false },
            { id: 'sonnet',  name: 'Claude Sonnet 4.6', color: '#b0b0b0', logo: LOGO_ANTHROPIC, highlight: false },
            { id: 'gemini',  name: 'Gemini 3 Pro',      color: '#bebebe', logo: LOGO_GEMINI,    highlight: false },
            { id: 'gpt',     name: 'GPT-5.4',           color: '#d2d2d2', logo: LOGO_OPENAI,    highlight: false },
        ];

        const multimodalData = [
            // Image (row 1)
            { name: 'CharXiv RQ', subtitle: 'Chart Understanding',
              scores: { mimo25: 81.0, omni: 80.1, opus46: 77.4, gemini: 81.4, kimi: 80.4 },
              floor: 60 },
            { name: 'MMMU-Pro', subtitle: 'Image Understanding & Reasoning',
              scores: { mimo25: 77.9, omni: 76.8, opus46: 73.9, gemini: 81.0, kimi: 79.4, gpt: 81.2 },
              floor: 60 },
            { name: 'HR-Bench (4k)', subtitle: 'High-Resolution Image Understanding',
              scores: { mimo25: 88.5, omni: 83.3, gemini: 86.4 },
              floor: 60 },
            { name: 'OmniDocBench', subtitle: 'Document Understanding',
              scores: { mimo25: 87.2, omni: 86.7, gpt: 89.0 },
              floor: 60 },
            // MM Agent + Video (row 2)
            { name: 'Claw-Eval Multimodal', subtitle: 'Real & Complex Multimodal Interactions',
              scores: { mimo25: 23.8, omni: 15.8, opus46: 24.8, sonnet: 23.8, gpt: 25.7, kimi: 18.8 },
              maxScale: 35, floor: 0 },
            { name: 'Video-MME', subtitle: 'General Video QA',
              scores: { mimo25: 87.7, omni: 85.3, gemini: 88.4 },
              floor: 60 },
            { name: 'DailyOmni', subtitle: 'Everyday Multimodal QA',
              scores: { mimo25: 83.5, omni: 80.5, gemini: 84.2 },
              floor: 60 },
            { name: 'VideoHolmes', subtitle: 'Complex Video Reasoning',
              scores: { mimo25: 64.0, omni: 59.5, gemini: 64.2 },
              floor: 40 },
        ];

        const multimodalRows = [
            // Row 1: Image â€” 4 benchmarks, each spanning 3/12 cols
            { labels: [{ text: 'Image Understanding', span: [1, 13] }],
              benchmarks: multimodalData.slice(0, 4),
              colSpanPer: 3 },
            // Row 2: MM Agent (1) + Video (3) â€” 4 benchmarks, each spanning 3/12 cols
            { labels: [
                { text: 'Multimodal Agent',    span: [1, 4] },
                { text: 'Video Understanding', span: [4, 13] },
              ],
              benchmarks: multimodalData.slice(4, 8),
              colSpanPer: 3 },
        ];

        // ---- Coding block ----
        const codingModels = [
            { id: 'mimo25', name: 'MiMo-V2.5',         color: '#FF6700', logo: LOGO_XIAOMI,    highlight: true  },
            { id: 'pro',    name: 'MiMo-V2-Pro',       color: '#8e8e8e', logo: LOGO_XIAOMI,    highlight: false },
            { id: 'kimi',   name: 'Kimi K2.6',         color: '#989898', logo: LOGO_KIMI,      highlight: false },
            { id: 'ds',     name: 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash', color: '#9c9c9c', logo: LOGO_DEEPSEEK,  highlight: false },
            { id: 'opus',   name: 'Claude Opus 4.6',   color: '#a0a0a0', logo: LOGO_ANTHROPIC, highlight: false },
            { id: 'gemini', name: 'Gemini 3.1 Pro',    color: '#bebebe', logo: LOGO_GEMINI,    highlight: false },
            { id: 'gpt',    name: 'GPT-5.4',           color: '#d2d2d2', logo: LOGO_OPENAI,    highlight: false },
        ];

        const codingData = [
            { name: 'MiMo Coding Bench', subtitle: 'Internal Coding Benchmark',
              scores: { mimo25: 71.8, pro: 71.5, opus: 77.1, gemini: 67.8 },
              floor: 40 },
            { name: 'Claw-Eval Text', subtitle: 'Text-Based Agent Interactions',
              scores: { mimo25: 62.3, pro: 57.8, opus: 70.8, gemini: 57.8, gpt: 60.3, kimi: 62.3, ds: 57.8 },
              floor: 40 },
            { name: 'Terminal-Bench 2.0', subtitle: 'Terminal Task Completion',
              scores: { mimo25: 65.8, pro: 57.1, opus: 65.4, gemini: 68.5, ds: 56.9, kimi: 66.7 },
              floor: 40 },
            { name: 'SWE-Bench Pro', subtitle: 'Real-World Bug Fixing',
              scores: { mimo25: 56.1, pro: 55.0, opus: 57.3, gemini: 54.2, gpt: 57.7, ds: 52.6, kimi: 58.6 },
              floor: 40 },
        ];

        const codingRows = [
            { labels: [
                { text: 'Coding Agent', span: [1, 3] },
                { text: 'Coding',       span: [3, 5] },
              ],
              benchmarks: codingData },
        ];

        // ==================== Rendering ====================
        function renderBenchBlock(models, rows, legendId, gridId) {
            const legendEl = document.getElementById(legendId);
            models.forEach(m => {
                legendEl.innerHTML += `
                    <span class="bench-legend-item${m.highlight ? ' mimo' : ''}">
                        <span class="bench-legend-dot" style="background: ${m.color}"></span>
                        <span class="bench-legend-label">${m.name}</span>
                    </span>
                `;
            });

            const gridEl = document.getElementById(gridId);
            let row = 1;

            rows.forEach(r => {
                if (r.labels.length > 0) {
                    r.labels.forEach(l => {
                        const el = document.createElement('div');
                        el.className = 'bench-section-label';
                        if (row > 1) el.style.marginTop = '1.5rem';
                        el.style.gridRow = row;
                        el.style.gridColumn = `${l.span[0]} / ${l.span[1]}`;
                        el.textContent = l.text;
                        gridEl.appendChild(el);
                    });
                    row++;
                }

                r.benchmarks.forEach((b, i) => {
                    const maxScale = b.maxScale || 100;
                    const floor = b.floor != null ? b.floor : 0;
                    const cell = document.createElement('div');
                    cell.className = 'bench-cell';
                    cell.style.gridRow = row;
                    const colSpan = r.colSpanPer || 1;
                    const startCol = i * colSpan + 1;
                    const endCol = startCol + colSpan;
                    cell.style.gridColumn = `${startCol} / ${endCol}`;

                    const barsHtml = models.map(m => {
                        const score = b.scores[m.id];
                        if (score == null) return '';
                        const h = ((score - floor) / (maxScale - floor)) * 100;
                        const displayScore = score.toFixed(1);
                        const barStyle = `height: ${h}%; background: ${m.color}`;
                        const logoClass = m.id === 'mimo25'
                            ? 'bench-bar-logo mimo-logo'
                            : 'bench-bar-logo gray-logo';
                        return `
                            <div class="bench-bar-col">
                                <div class="bench-bar" style="${barStyle}">
                                    <span class="bench-bar-score" style="color: ${m.color}">${displayScore}</span>
                                    <div class="bench-bar-tooltip">${m.name}: ${displayScore}</div>
                                </div>
                                <img src="${m.logo}" class="${logoClass}" alt="${m.name}">
                            </div>
                        `;
                    }).join('');

                    cell.innerHTML = `
                        <div class="bench-bars-wrap">
                            <div class="bench-bars">${barsHtml}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bench-cell-title">${b.name}</div>
                    `;
                    gridEl.appendChild(cell);
                });
                row++;
            });
        }

        renderBenchBlock(multimodalModels, multimodalRows, 'multimodal-legend', 'multimodal-grid');
        renderBenchBlock(codingModels,     codingRows,     'coding-legend',     'coding-grid');
    </script>
</body>
